==Battleground==
*2 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~60 seconds<sup>600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Mistress Celeboodle]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 8.33~25 seconds<sup>250f~750f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Because of the strength magnifications of these aliens, it is expected that you obtain the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from the first two [[Into the Future]] Chapters to make them feasible.

This stage can be rushed with a level 30 [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], just be sure that you protect him from Nimoy Bore's attacks using meatshields.

If you do not have Awakened Bahamut Cat, you can use Crazed Bahamut Cat, [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] or any other anti-alien cats you may own, although Crazed Bahamut may be less reliable than its true form.

